<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6609] H2PkHashIndex.H2Cursor doesn&apos;t take in count expiration</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6609</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Correct: &lt;tt&gt;H2Cursor#next&lt;/tt&gt; - expire time is checked;&lt;br/&gt;
Incorrect: &lt;tt&gt;H2PkHashIndex.H2Cursor#next&lt;/tt&gt; - expired time is ignored.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
