                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16773194" author="pkouznet" created="Wed, 20 Feb 2019 16:56:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve done the trivial changes. &lt;br/&gt;
1) Don&apos;t we have other Cursors to do same thing left?&lt;br/&gt;
2) These changes doesn&apos;t seem to be easy-to-test, any ideas?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=tledkov-gridgain&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;tledkov-gridgain&quot;&gt;tledkov-gridgain&lt;/a&gt;, could you please take a look at the patch ?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16774384" author="pkouznet" created="Thu, 21 Feb 2019 18:27:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;p2: do we need to check row for expire time in the &lt;tt&gt;org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.query.h2.database.H2TreeIndex#find&lt;/tt&gt; ?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (!cctx.mvccEnabled() &amp;amp;&amp;amp; indexType.isPrimaryKey() &amp;amp;&amp;amp; lower != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt; &amp;amp;&amp;amp; upper != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt; &amp;amp;&amp;amp;
                tree.compareRows((H2Row)lower, (H2Row)upper) == 0) {
                H2Row row = tree.findOne((H2Row)lower, filter(qryCtxRegistry.getThreadLocal()), &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;);

                &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; (row == &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;) ? GridH2Cursor.EMPTY : &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; SingleRowCursor(row);
            }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16776627" author="vozerov" created="Mon, 25 Feb 2019 08:24:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkouznet&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkouznet&quot;&gt;pkouznet&lt;/a&gt;, fix looks good, but there are no tests. Note that index usage can be forced with &lt;tt&gt;USE INDEX&lt;/tt&gt; hint &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.h2database.com/html/performance.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://www.h2database.com/html/performance.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16776788" author="pkouznet" created="Mon, 25 Feb 2019 11:50:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt; Thank you for the link.&lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;ve pushed the tests.&lt;br/&gt;
I experienced that index hints doesn&apos;t work if we want to set tree index.&lt;br/&gt;
next query actually causes using the hash index: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-sql&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;SELECT&lt;/span&gt; * &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;FROM&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;notEager&quot;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;Integer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;use&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;index&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;_key_PK&quot;&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;WHERE&lt;/span&gt; id &amp;gt;= 42 &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; id &amp;lt;= 42
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;so I din&apos;t use index hints in the tests for the tree index.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16777756" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 26 Feb 2019 09:22:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good. Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16783576" author="ignitetcbot" created="Mon, 4 Mar 2019 17:28:06 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #F7D6C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: Possible Blockers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d04437&quot;&gt;MVCC Cache 3&lt;/font&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3175720]&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;[tests 0 TIMEOUT , Exit Code &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d04437&quot;&gt;Cache (Full API)&lt;/font&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3175676]&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;[tests 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IgniteCacheFullApiSelfTestSuite: GridCacheReplicatedNearOnlyMultiNodeFullApiSelfTest.testTtlTx - 0,0% fails in last 599 master runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3175732&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
